# Google Places — live reviews on the About page
#
# 1. Google Cloud Console → enable billing on the project
# 2. Enable BOTH:
#    - Places API
#    - Places API (New)
# 3. Create an API key for server use on Vercel:
#    - Application restrictions: None
#      (HTTP referrer restrictions break server-side calls)
#    - API restrictions: restrict to Places API + Places API (New)
# 4. Place ID for Ask Alex Physiotherapy:
#    ChIJtZjbUsIYO6sREzKjp4wvJEE
# 5. Optional: paste your preferred Business Profile / reviews share link
#    (from Google Business Profile → Share). If omitted, we use Google's
#    reviews page for your Place ID.

GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
